# Ribbon descriptions compose ordinary static UI data. Tabs own their selection.
import lib/ui_components.dl

a ribbon scroll arrow {fixed integer:direction} means: UI node 38 with "" colored "" sized direction by 0 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at 0 0 measuring 24 by 108 styled "chevron"

section ribbon {C string:name} at {integer:left} {integer:top} sized {integer:width} by {integer:height}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI component 28 labeled name styled "" at left top sized width by height containing (the body's children)

section tab {C string:name}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI container of kind 29 containing (the body's children) named name

section ribbon group {C string:name}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI container of kind 30 containing (the body's children) named name

section tool row:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI container of kind 31 containing (the body's children) named ""

section tool column:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI container of kind 32 containing (the body's children) named ""

tool {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} means: a UI component 33 labeled name styled icon at 0 0 sized 0 by 28 containing no UI children
large tool {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 1 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at 0 0 measuring 0 by 84 styled icon
icon tool {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 2 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at 0 0 measuring 30 by 28 styled icon
theme preview {C string:name} in {C string:color} means: UI node 33 with name colored color sized 0 by 3 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at 0 0 measuring 104 by 84 styled ""

section large menu {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 1 bordered 0 containing (the body's children) acting no UI action at 0 0 measuring 0 by 84 styled icon

section tool menu {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI component 33 labeled name styled icon at 0 0 sized 0 by 28 containing (the body's children)

section tool field {C string:text} sized {integer:width}:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI component 34 labeled text styled "" at 0 0 sized width by 28 containing (the body's children)

menu item {C string:text} with icon {C string:icon} means: a UI component 35 labeled text styled icon at 0 0 sized 0 by 32 containing no UI children
menu item {C string:text} means: menu item text with icon ""

icon command {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} at {integer:left} {integer:top} sized {integer:width} by {integer:height} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 2 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at left top measuring width by height styled icon
command {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} at {integer:left} {integer:top} sized {integer:width} by {integer:height} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 4 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at left top measuring width by height styled icon
accent command {C string:name} with icon {C string:icon} at {integer:left} {integer:top} sized {integer:width} by {integer:height} means: UI node 33 with name colored "orange" sized 0 by 4 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at left top measuring width by height styled icon
profile command {C string:name} at {integer:left} {integer:top} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 5 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at left top measuring 30 by 30 styled ""
search command {C string:name} at {integer:left} {integer:top} sized {integer:width} means: UI node 33 with name colored "" sized 0 by 6 bordered 0 containing no UI children acting no UI action at left top measuring width by 32 styled "search"

to get the selected tab of {UI reference:ribbon} in {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    require condition ((ribbon's kind = 28) and (ribbon's count > 0)) reporting "A ribbon requires at least one tab"
    set index to (the UI value for ribbon in instance)'s number
    require condition ((index >= 0) and (index < ribbon's count)) reporting "The selected ribbon tab is outside its description"
    return the UI child at index in ribbon
